act":null,"logo":"https://images.schweizmobil.ch/image/ML_UR_DH_Haldi_Schattdorf_140px.jpg","logo_svg":"https://images.schweizmobil.ch/image-svg/ML_430_UR_DH_Haldi_Schattdorf.svg","x_coordinate":693677.0232356,"y_coordinate":191356.56354954143,"description":"If you are looking for the ultimate kick and you have got a bike with long suspension and adequate equipment, then you will love this downhill ride.\n\nThe exciting downhill ride leads you through the steep Gosmer valley on a partly natural single trail with prepared corners, jumps and natural obstacles of roots and rocks. The first part offers tight corners with challenging obstacles and passages with slopes of up to 30 percent. Next on a short ride on the forest road you branch off right into the forest Bannwald of Schattdorf and you start the second part of the route - the free ride part. There are big, wide and steep abutments with fast corners, which provide the ultimate flow. The additional compressions and jumps give you the required kick and get every downhill fan's heart pumping. The last part then leads you along the forest road back to the starting point, the gondola station of Haldi, down in Schattdorf.","length":4,"length_asphalt":0,"length_unsurfaced":2,"length_singletrail":2,"height_difference":70,"height_difference_back":680,"height_downwards":null,"hiking_time":null,"hiking_time_back":null,"category_grade":"difficult","category_grade_text":null,"category_grade_skiing":null,"category_condition":"easy","category_condition_text":null,"cantons":[4],"photo_gallery":["https://images.schweizmobil.ch/image/ML_430_DH-Haldi-1_s.jpg","https://images.schweizmobil.ch/image/ML_430_DH_Haldi_Bannwald_Schattdorf_Downhilbiker_P_2010_a.jpg","https://images.schweizmobil.ch/image/ML_430_DH_Haldi_2_b.jpg"],"photo_gallery_big":["https://images.schweizmobil.ch/image-big/ML_430_DH-Haldi-1_g.jpg","",""],"photo_gallery_urls":[null,null,null],"photo_gallery_ids":["216210","3287","3288"],"photo_gallery_copyright":["","",""]